  "title": "Vote.org Wins Webby Award for Responsible Information",
  "summary": "Vote.org was recognized today by the 30th Annual Webby Awards with a Webby People’s Voice Award for Responsible Information in the Websites and Mobile Sites category – an award determined entirely by the voting public. The honor recognizes web products, platforms, software, or technologies that are effectively working to combat disinformation, misinformation, and false or misleading information online.",
